rd-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">第二块是外资</span>，他们是市场里最聪明的资金，底部第一波拉升，和顶部第一波砸盘都是外资点火。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;text-decoration: none;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;cursor: text;box-sizing: border-box;counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0;color: rgb(72, 87, 106);font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 13px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\">最近的例子，去年924第一波是外资拉的，10月8号也是外资砸的，这个从港股的外资交易席位就能看到。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;text-decoration: none;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;cursor: text;box-sizing: border-box;counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0;color: rgb(72, 87, 106);font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 13px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\">在2021年之前，能看到北上资金的时候，也能明显发现顶底第一波都是北上资金大幅异动。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;text-decoration: none;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;cursor: text;box-sizing: border-box;counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0;color: rgb(72, 87, 106);font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 13px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;text-decoration: none;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;cursor: text;box-sizing: border-box;counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0;color: rgb(72, 87, 106);font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 13px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">第三块是散户和基金，基金其实也是散户</span>。这部分资金特征是追涨杀跌，就是等行情拉起来之后他们才冲进来，加速行情的涨跌。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;text-decoration: none;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;cursor: text;box-sizing: border-box;counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0;color: rgb(72, 87, 106);font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 13px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;text-decoration: none;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;cursor: text;box-sizing: border-box;counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0;color: rgb(72, 87, 106);font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 13px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\">去年9月30号之后就是散户和基金追进来导致的。这也是为什么去年成交量放了天量，就是因为现在大家手里钱很多。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;text-decoration: none;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;cursor: text;box-sizing: border-box;counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0;color: rgb(72, 87, 106);font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 13px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;text-decoration: none;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;cursor: text;box-sizing: border-box;counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0;color: rgb(72, 87, 106);font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 13px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\" textstyle=\"\">本来我还想，去年那么大的成交量，可能要用很长时间震荡来消化，现在看不需要，只需要下一波行情起更大的成交量就行了！是完全有这个可能的。</span></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;text-decoration: none;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;cursor: text;box-sizing: border-box;counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0;color: rgb(72, 87, 106);font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 13px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;text-decoration: none;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;cursor: text;box-sizing: border-box;counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0;color: rgb(72, 87, 106);font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 13px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\">不过虽然散户手里钱很多，但刚才说了散户是追涨杀跌型的，所以现在不会进，要等一个主力资金点火后他们才冲进来，而这个点火的资金只有外资。所以，就静等外资进场的那一刻。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;text-decoration: none;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;cursor: text;box-sizing: border-box;counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0;color: rgb(72, 87, 106);font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 13px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;text-decoration: none;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;cursor: text;box-sizing: border-box;counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0;color: rgb(72, 87, 106);font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 13px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\">长期看，美债利率也肯定会下降，只是时间问题。</span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;text-decoration: none;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;cursor: text;box-sizing: border-box;counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0;color: rgb(72, 87, 106);font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 13px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></p><p style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;text-decoration: none;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;cursor: text;box-sizing: border-box;counter-reset: list-1 0 list-2 0 list-3 0 list-4 0 list-5 0 list-6 0 list-7 0 list-8 0 list-9 0;color: rgb(72, 87, 106);font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 13px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-align: left;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: pre-wrap;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span leaf=\"\">现在美联储硬撑着高利率，妄想拉爆咱们的楼市。但自己的经济也撑不住了，5月房地产开工数据跌了10%，失业率也开始增加。就看还能死撑到什么时候了。</span></p><section><span leaf=\"\"><br/></span></section><p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p></div>",
